      "description": "Wants to initialize — or bootstrap, or install, or load, or harness — a harness: bootstrap itself, or any Harness built on it. Carries no skills deliberately: WHICH harness this repository should become is a judgement about intent, and no instruction body produces it. The Bootstrapping Agent may narrow the list from context; only the Requestor settles it.",
